## 🧠 2. Recursive DFS Patterns

### 🔹 Concept
Use recursion on left and right subtrees, then combine results (divide & conquer).  
Used for computing tree properties (height, diameter, balance, etc.).

### 🔹 How to Identify
If problem involves **combining results from subtrees**, it’s recursive DFS.

