## ⚙️ 3. Iterative Traversal Patterns

### 🔹 Concept
Perform tree traversals **without recursion** using Stack (DFS) or Queue (BFS).

### 🔹 How to Identify
If recursion is restricted or you must use O(1) space → iterative traversal.

