## 🪄 Tip to Identify Patterns Quickly

| Pattern | Common Keywords | Intuition |
|----------|----------------|------------|
| Traversal | print, order, zigzag, level | Visit all nodes |
| DFS Recursive | height, sum, balanced, diameter | Combine subtree results |
| Iterative | iterative, stack, queue | Replace recursion |
| Path-Based | path, sum, root to leaf | Track cumulative path |
| View / Boundary | top, bottom, right, visible | Level-based visibility |
| Height/Diameter | height, depth, balanced | Compute subtree metrics |
| BST | BST, search, kth smallest | Use sorted property |
| Construction | build, preorder, inorder | Split arrays recursively |
| Ancestor / Distance | LCA, ancestor, distance | Relationship between nodes |
| Advanced | flatten, serialize, convert | Transform tree structure |

